    // Contract specs read other packages' **source as text** to pin the portal's
    // copy of a rule to the original (`*.contract.spec.ts`: A-02 forbids
    // importing `services/*/src`, so the portal keeps copies and a test compares
    // them). Those files live outside this package, so without naming them here
    // a change to one would replay a cached green for the very test meant to
    // catch it. This list is not a convention to remember: `src/test/
    // turbo-inputs-guard.ts` fails any spec that reads a file outside this
    // package that is not named below, and `src/turbo-config.spec.ts` keeps the
    // two lists equal and every entry real.
